item.panascais_caves:the_deep_mistake_scroll.title=Pergamino del error profundo\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7They tunneled where no dwarf dared\nbefore. The pick struck stone, but\nthe stone bled black. The mountain\ntrembled and this was the first\nbreath "IT" took in millennia.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_deep_mistake_scroll.name=Pergamino del error profundo
item.panascais_caves:the_binding_scroll.title=Pergamino de la vinculación\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Five mages stood beneath the\nmountain's heart, hands trembling\nwith grief. What they forged was not\nart, but warding-sigils drawn from\npain, hammered into silence.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_binding_scroll.name=Pergamino de la vinculación
item.panascais_caves:the_scattering_scroll.title=Pergamino de la dispersión\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Una bestia, cinco sellos. To keep it\ndreaming, the sigils were shattered\nand buried in places no map\nnames-where frost gnaws, fires weep,\nand nothing speaks.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_scattering_scroll.name=Pergamino de la dispersión
item.panascais_caves:the_glyphs_scroll.title=Pergamino de los glifos\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7A stone altar listens beneath the\nworld. Five marks wait-not for\ntouch, but memory. The matching must\nbe true, or the silence deepens.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_glyphs_scroll.name=Pergamino de los glifos
item.panascais_caves:the_awakening_scroll.title=Pergamino del despertar\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7La piedra se agrieta. El polvo respira. The\naltar groans beneath ancient weight.\nWhen the fifth mark finds its place,\nThe Serpent stirs. Coils unwind,\neyes open without light, and the\nmountain forgets its silence.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_awakening_scroll.name=Pergamino del despertar
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_flame_scroll.title=Pergamino de la prueba de la llama\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7In the lakes that blaze and howl,\nEmber waits behind walls of living\nfire. Only the worthy walk\nunscorched-their path cools where\nothers burn.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_flame_scroll.name=Pergamino de la prueba de la llama
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_water_scroll.title=Pergamino de la prueba del agua\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Water hides where ice breathes blue\nand light bends twice. Align the\nmirrors to reveal its shape-only\nperfect stillness sees what's real.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_water_scroll.name=Pergamino de la prueba del agua
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_wind_scroll.title=Pergamino de la prueba del viento\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Wind drifts among open roots and\nquiet rivers. It does not lie still-\nfollow the breeze, and step where\nsilence welcomes you.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_wind_scroll.name=Pergamino de la prueba del viento
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_earth_scroll.title=Pergamino de la prueba de la tierra\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Buried in the earth, beneath dust\nand gemlight. amatista spires and\nbroken deserts hold its shape. Only\nthe heavy-hearted may lift it.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_earth_scroll.name=Pergamino de la prueba de la tierra
item.panascais_caves:whispers_of_the_forgemaster_scroll.title=Pergamino de los susurros del maestro forjador\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7It cleaves stone, splits timber, and\ncarves paths no other tool dares-\nRunabreaker, the Forgemaster's last\ncreation. Not forged to fight, but\nto shape the world itself. The runes\nbend to its will. The mountain\nremembers its name.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:whispers_of_the_forgemaster_scroll.name=Pergamino de los susurros del maestro forjador
item.panascais_caves:lost_in_collapse_scroll.title=Pergamino perdido en el derrumbe\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7When the serpent was sealed away and\nthe mountains fell silent, all\nrecords of the Runabreaker vanished.\nSome say it lies buried beneath the\nbeast itself in the shattered altar,\nwaiting for a soul bold enough to\ndig deep.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:lost_in_collapse_scroll.name=Pergamino perdido en el derrumbe
item.panascais_caves:facets_of_power_scroll.title=Pergamino de facetas de poder\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Six gemstones-Zafiro, Esfalerita,\nEsmeralda, Rubí, Ópalo cristalino, and\nÓnix- each forged as a fragment of\ndwarven mastery. Only when gathered\ncan the ancient tool be touched.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:facets_of_power_scroll.name=Pergamino de facetas de poder
item.panascais_caves:runes_in_stone_scroll.title=Pergamino de runas en piedra\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7The serpent bears five wounds hidden\nbeneath petrified coil. When it\nfalls, they open... and the\ngemstones call out.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:runes_in_stone_scroll.name=Pergamino de runas en piedra
item.panascais_caves:the_forgotten_trial_scroll.title=Pergamino de la prueba olvidada\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7En la arboleda olvidada por el tiempo,\nlas runas duermen bajo reliquias\nque se desmoronan. Lo que el mundo\nolvida, el tiempo espera con paciencia\na quienes buscan lo perdido.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_forgotten_trial_scroll.name=Pergamino de la prueba olvidada
item.panascais_caves:the_runebreaker_scroll.title=Pergamino del Runabreaker\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Coloca las seis gemas en lo que\noculta la serpiente, y la montaña\nresponderá. La reliquia despertará. No\ncon llama ni acero, sino con poder\nnegado desde hace mucho.\n§r§r
item.panascais_caves:the_runebreaker_scroll.name=Pergamino del Runabreaker
