waila.item.panascais_caves:the_deep_mistake_scroll=Pergamino del error profundo\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Excavaron donde ningún enano se atrevió antes.\nThe pick struck stone, but the stone bled\nblack. The mountain trembled and this was\nthe first breath "IT" took in millennia.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:the_binding_scroll=Pergamino de la vinculación\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Five mages stood beneath the mountain's\nheart, hands trembling with grief. What\nthey forged was not art, but\nwarding-sigils drawn from pain, hammered\ninto silence.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:the_scattering_scroll=Pergamino de la dispersión\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Una bestia, cinco sellos. To keep it\ndreaming, the sigils were shattered and\nburied in places no map names-where frost\ngnaws, fires weep, and nothing speaks.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:the_glyphs_scroll=Pergamino de los glifos\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Un altar de piedra escucha bajo el mundo.\nCinco marcas esperan, no el tacto, sino la memoria.\nThe matching must be true, or the silence\ndeepens.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:the_awakening_scroll=Pergamino del despertar\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7La piedra se agrieta. El polvo respira. The altar\ngroans beneath ancient weight. When the\nfifth mark finds its place, The Serpent\nstirs. Coils unwind, eyes open without\nlight, and the mountain forgets its\nsilence.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_flame_scroll=Pergamino de la prueba de la llama\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7In the lakes that blaze and howl, Ember\nwaits behind walls of living fire. Only\nthe worthy walk unscorched-their path\ncools where others burn.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_water_scroll=Pergamino de la prueba del agua\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Water hides where ice breathes blue and\nlight bends twice. Align the mirrors to\nreveal its shape-only perfect stillness\nsees what's real.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_wind_scroll=Pergamino de la prueba del viento\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Wind drifts among open roots and quiet\nrivers. It does not lie still- follow the\nbreeze, and step where silence welcomes\nyou.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:the_trial_of_earth_scroll=Pergamino de la prueba de la tierra\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Buried in the earth, beneath dust and\ngemlight. amatista spires and broken\ndeserts hold its shape. Only the\nheavy-hearted may lift it.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:whispers_of_the_forgemaster_scroll=Pergamino de los susurros del maestro forjador\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7It cleaves stone, splits timber, and\ncarves paths no other tool dares-\nRunabreaker, the Forgemaster's last\ncreation. Not forged to fight, but to\nshape the world itself. The runes bend to\nits will. La montaña recuerda su nombre.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:lost_in_collapse_scroll=Pergamino perdido en el derrumbe\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7When the serpent was sealed away and the\nmountains fell silent, all records of the\nRunabreaker vanished. Some say it lies\nburied beneath the beast itself in the\nshattered altar, waiting for a soul bold\nenough to dig deep.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:facets_of_power_scroll=Pergamino de facetas de poder\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Six gemstones-Zafiro, Esfalerita,\nEsmeralda, Rubí, Ópalo cristalino, and Ónix-\neach forged as a fragment of dwarven\nmastery. Only when gathered can the\nancient tool be touched.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:runes_in_stone_scroll=Pergamino de runas en piedra\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7The serpent bears five wounds hidden\nbeneath petrified coil. When it falls,\nthey open... and the gemstones call out.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:the_forgotten_trial_scroll=Pergamino de la prueba olvidada\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7En la arboleda olvidada por el tiempo,\nlas runas duermen bajo reliquias rotas. Lo\nque el mundo olvida, el tiempo espera\ncon paciencia a quien busca lo perdido.\n§r§r
waila.item.panascais_caves:the_runebreaker_scroll=Pergamino del Runabreaker\n§9Eternal Caves Add-On\n\n§7Coloca las seis gemas en lo que\noculta la serpiente, y la montaña\nresponderá. La reliquia despertará. No con\nllama ni acero, sino con un poder\nnegado desde hace mucho.\n§r§r
